  moduleTitle: Killswitch Engage
  moduleText: 'Parkway Drive is a modern heavy metal band part of the american metalcore
    scene. Their heaviest album is The End of Heartache. They''ve had 2 singers throughout
    their carrer, the first one being Howard Jones. Their songs tend to cover a lot
    of motivational topics. Some of their members: Jesse (Vocals), Adam (Lead Guitar)'
